#
# Vendored upstream files are pinned byte for byte: a SHA-384 per file
# in <extension>/upstream/PIN.json, a SHA-256 per file and per tree in
# <extension>/provenance/*/UPSTREAM-PROVENANCE.json. A Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf (the GitHub Windows runners' default) rewrites
# line endings and every digest with them. Check these out exactly as
# committed, on every platform. Patterns here are relative to
# extensions/, which is why this file lives in it.
*/upstream/** -text
*/provenance/** -text
